gnificantly throughout most of the battle.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\"><div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Melee</span> (0-400)</div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-creature-resistance-table\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Damage_Taken_From_Elements\">Damage Taken From Elements</span></h3>\n<div id=\"w-creature-resistance-d\">\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.2500\" title=\"Physical\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Physical <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Bestiary Physical Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bestiary_Physical_Icon_Big_83da43.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:25.0000%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 75.0000%); display:inline-block;\">25%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.2500\" title=\"Death\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Death <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Cursed Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cursed_Icon_Big_de8a1f.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:25.0000%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 75.0000%); display:inline-block;\">25%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.2500\" title=\"Holy\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Holy <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Dazzled Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dazzled_Icon_Big_546495.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:25.0000%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 75.0000%); display:inline-block;\">25%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.2500\" title=\"Ice\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Ice <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Freezing Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Freezing_Icon_Big_4dcec8.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:25.0000%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 75.0000%); display:inline-block;\">25%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.2500\" title=\"Fire\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Fire <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Burning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Burning_Icon_Big_a56686.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:25.0000%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 75.0000%); display:inline-block;\">25%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.2500\" title=\"Energy\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Energy <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Electrified Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Electrified_Icon_Big_b60abe.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:25.0000%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 75.0000%); display:inline-block;\">25%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.2500\" title=\"Earth\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Earth <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poisoned Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_Big_f04eb1.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:25.0000%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 75.0000%); display:inline-block;\">25%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Two floors down in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Underground%20Glooth%20Factory\">Underground Glooth Factory</a> - (west side), only accessible during the raid. The closest spawn point is located <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33518,31963,13\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33518, 31963, 13)</a>. Additional spawn locations are <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33510,31944,13\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33510, 31944, 13)</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33470,31952,13\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33470, 31952, 13)</a>, and <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33419,31949,13\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33419, 31949, 13)</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tEvery 10 seconds, it will vanish and reappear, although it can reappear multiple times in a row in the same location.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tIt is strongly recommended to remain stationary and concentrate your efforts at a single spawn location. Stay vigilant and be prepared to engage in combat immediately upon the spawn event. Mages are encouraged to summon creatures such as <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Elemental\">Fire Elementals</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Devil\">Fire Devils</a>, while players above level 200 should utilize their <a href=\"#/wiki/Familiars\">ultimate summons</a>. Additionally you can use your damage over time spells such as <a href=\"#/wiki/Inflict%20Wound\">Inflict Wound</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Holy%20Flash\">Holy Flash</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Curse\">Curse</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ignite\">Ignite</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Electrify\">Electrify</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Envenom\">Envenom</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"7b56e03e25ad4bd22da47482e37adf1f\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:138px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Tremor_Worm_Battle-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:136px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"Fighting Tremor Worm with a small team.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Fighting Tremor Worm with a small team.\" height=\"136\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tremor_Worm_Battle_5588ec.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Tremor Worm Battle.png (245 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Fighting Tremor Worm with a small team.</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 14 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples — current sample size is below this threshold.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Health%20Potion\"><img alt=\"Great Health Potion\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Great_Health_Potion_3134b1.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Health%20Potion\">Great Health Potion</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>7-23</td>\n<td>12.6</td>\n<td class=\"\" data-sort-value=\"100.000000\" style=\"text-align:center;\">100%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ultimate%20Health%20Potion\"><img alt=\"Ultimate Health Potion\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ultimate_Health_Potion_80aa2f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Ultimate%20Health%20Potion\">Ultimate H